-## Transform Ownership
-
-### Mapping
-
-```text
-SLAM Toolbox:
-  map → odom
-
-diff_drive_controller:
-  odom → base_link
-
-robot_state_publisher:
-  base_link → robot links and sensors
-```
-
-### Localization and Navigation
-
-```text
-AMCL:
-  map → odom
-
-diff_drive_controller:
-  odom → base_link
-
-robot_state_publisher:
-  base_link → robot links and sensors
-```
-
-Avoid running multiple publishers for the same TF edge.
