+# v0.1.3 Manual Release Checklist
+
+Stop if the candidate changes, local validation fails, hosted CI is not green, or the PR contains unexpected files.
+
+## Review, commit, and push
+
+```bash
+cd /home/devansh/robotics_projects/ros2-amr-v013
+git branch --show-current
+git rev-parse HEAD
+git status --short --branch
+git diff --cached --check
+git diff --cached --stat v0.1.2
+git diff --cached v0.1.2
+git add -u
+git add docs/v0.1.3_release_notes.md docs/v0.1.3_manual_release_checklist.md docs/v0.1.3_media_capture_plan.md docs/v0.1.3_linkedin_package.md docs/v0.1.4_handoff.md docs/evidence/v0.1.3/2026-11-06_171445Z
+git diff --cached --check
+git status --short --branch
+git commit -m "feat: finalize v0.1.3 readiness contracts"
+git show --stat --oneline --decorate HEAD
+git push -u origin feature/v0.1.3-readiness-contracts
+```
+
+Confirm package version `0.1.3`, the evidence manifest, and intended staging. Only the four documented failed-attempt evidence directories should remain untracked. Record the commit ID in the PR; the evidence source-diff hash must reconcile to that commit.
+
